sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as forming ship (or argo)
  participant F as fleet (core)
  participant Q as squadrons ship
  participant G as flagship (run by squadrons)
  participant M as member ships
  T->>F: send to squadrons: squadron.form+json (blueprint, parameters, key)
  alt reach refuses
    F-->>T: NOT_REACHABLE
  else stored
    F-->>T: OK
  end
  Q->>F: receive, ack, fleet.ship of the sender: its scopes
  alt lacks squadrons:form
    Q->>F: reply refused: needs squadrons:form
  else a squadrons limit reached
    Q->>F: reply refused, naming the limit
  else blueprint invalid, or names a scope squadrons cannot grant
    Q->>F: reply refused, naming the problem, nothing commissioned
  else repeat of the same key
    Q->>F: the first answer again
  else forms
    Q->>F: commission flagship and members, each with the scopes its template names
    Q->>F: labels, declared rules, a crew request per member
    Q->>F: reply formed: squadron id, flagship name
  end
  M->>F: send flagship squadron.relay+json
  G->>F: receive, ack
  G->>F: send forming ship squadron.relay+json (squadron, member, its message id, payload)
  alt forming ship retired or unreachable
    G->>F: tells argo once, keeps the relay for the operator
  else delivered
    T->>F: reply to the relay
    G->>F: send member, inReplyTo its original message
  end
  T->>F: send flagship squadron.stand-down+json
  alt sender is not the forming ship or argo
    G->>F: reply refused
  else forming ship or argo
    G->>M: stand down as today
    G->>F: reply standing down
  end
